0261013` ([grant](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/issues/744#issuecomment-6133771506), [lease](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/8832ba673d1168d0cf8146ca4945838d44f69210/ops/leases/wp744-r2-g2-antigravity-windows.yaml)). Frozen spec SHA-256 `9391705db12b820af9eb59fe05cc2008eebde648964b8a6be8e063ed957adba8`. Base `8aebf14af7d3918e4e45fc42569c2c156f9b3ca9`.\n\nExecutor: Google Antigravity Gemini editing session `21254d04-e7cd-4dfa-99d3-acab9c0c0f56`, Windows, Antigravity machine/local. The CLI selected `gemini-3.8-flash-high` and logged the backend model override; per-response model metadata was not exposed. Headless command permissions were unavailable, so Codex dispatcher independently ran the gates and transported the exact four-file edit. Reviewer must be a fresh read-only Codex session on exact head; no cross approval is claimed by this PR body.\n\n## Scope and P2 closure at spec level\n\n- Correct four r2 specs for WP725–728. Historical direct-to-master routing is recorded as a Protocol §5 deviation without retroactive exception; future Packet PRs use mission integration and land gate.\n- Distinguish `False` after stage rc4 from `None`/contradiction; export/new and keep-warm stage once.\n- Pin Linux audit target full SHA and two blob OIDs; require pre-run mismatch rejection, four-cycle rig, mutant/generator, and SHA256SUMS. Runtime and Linux audit remain OPEN pending separate measured Packets.\n\n## Local evidence on exact head\n\n- Head `fffd14f4546f5eb44b3fe1138bc49c9703c7ed97`; tree `72785c6c1e884bc0b5c1771df644622d590223b4`.\n- `git diff --check`: rc 0; four files only, UTF-8 LF.\n- `python scripts/pkg_secret_scan.py <temporary directory containing exact four files>`: rc 0. Direct four-file invocation returned rc 2 because this script accepts a directory only; no secret-scan pass was inferred from that attempt.\n- `python scripts/tl.py --selftest`: rc 0, `1731/1731`, strict `[FAIL]` lines 0. Output SHA-256 `3f8e065159210a88c61e33cb5bfd28ddf0b7722b6d11340af5bfce326358c6ec`.\n- Not measured: LIVE, real credentials, runtime canary/stage behavior, Linux zombie audit. No merge or land authority requested here.\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-12T22:58:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T01:37:07Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T01:37:07Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"22b1a68e27cb5bfb938e3f3a29f956873e42c62a","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"ducthangho:agent/wp744-g2-antigravity","ref":"agent/wp744-g2-antigravity","repo":{"id":1289195917,"node_id":"R_kgDOTNeRjQ","name":"tra-luat","full_name":"ducthangho/tra-luat","owner":{"login":"ducthangho","id":12748935,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzQ4OTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12748935?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho","html_url":"https://github.com/ducthangho","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ducthangho/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":true,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":null,"homepage":null,"language":"Python","visibility":"private","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_issues_count":212,"open_issues":212,"size":70540,"default_branch":"master","has_issues":true,"